{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_title", "source_sha256": "39e4d625d7284b1bcfda0023f93e3e0e7e59109ea4a9c127d32ba9075210637b", "ja": "うみみん☆キャンプへようこそ！", "zh": "欢迎来到海美美☆露营！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b2a516033cff824edc2769fd7a11d654101a27e33dc89c500a953ebd881bbcb9", "ja": "もうすぐ学校で体育祭がある事を、憂鬱そう\nに語るロコ。スポーツの楽しさを教えたい！\nと、新曲からヒントを得た海美は、劇場での\nお泊り特訓会を企画する。運動を楽しんだメ\nンバー達は、パワフルな公演を完成させた。", "zh": "ROCO忧郁地提起学校马上就要举办体育祭了。\n想要告诉她运动的乐趣！\n海美从新曲中获得启发，策划了在剧场\n留宿的特训会。享受了运动乐趣的\n成员们，最终完成了一场充满力量的公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1000_029umi", "source_sha256": "745b9f5f436016c08be04ed83704871f50861c5d914dff7f4c218e36f5504d09", "ja": "おっはよう～！\nえっと……これで全員揃ったかな？", "zh": "早上好～！\n那个……这样人就到齐了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "58df776cb157facf6f054b23ef43b53c6291a1192cb61d16bb9e21416f6e0195", "ja": "おはおは～！　なんか面白そうだから来ちゃった！\nうみみんパーティーを盛り上げるのだ―！", "zh": "早上好早上好～！感觉好像很有意思，我就来啦！\n要让海美美的派对热闹起来哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "5c25d61dd976e4b60d5f8bb7cb5ba942132c3fc7b9b56a48eb4d2d5acdf1b496", "ja": "たまきもうみみの公演に出るんだ♪\n特訓も楽しみだぞ～。くふふ♪", "zh": "环也要参加海美的演出♪  \n特训也很期待哦～。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "58ba73ef3c0fd5d565d4db8569c72cc18c710368e24d1846a185cf4e229b16bb", "ja": "えへ♪　にぎやかなお泊り特訓になりそうだね！\nみんなワイワイ～♪　お泊り大会～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿♪看来会变成一次热热闹闹的留宿特训呢！\n大家一起热热闹闹～♪留宿大会～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "a7c0ec7747405182b148eacbb9c5d32bb12f73b5e116b35026f39cce371dc0f9", "ja": "今日はね、難しいことをするつもりはないんだ。\nもちろん体を動かしたり、レッスンもするけど……。", "zh": "今天呢，没打算做什么困难的事情。\n当然也会活动身体、上课训练，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "ae37b07d27ccd85b873daf0c82347cd3fc8abf74e0dace9db9f2b02ac54cd88c", "ja": "とにかく、みんなで楽しみながらやりたい！\nよろしくね☆", "zh": "总之，我想和大家一起开心地进行！\n请多多关照哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "d0378700c95b9b18d6cc9cc302b379fb1d378878bb10b73e339f37f26c7d72c8", "ja": "オフコースです！　メンバー的にも、\nとってもエンジョイできる気がします！", "zh": "当然可以！我觉得从成员们的角度来看，也一定能玩得非常开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1007_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "4abff543ffbc62e300ccb7651bef638f8a56c244ef22a1c79c2d7147dc0fa9f5", "ja": "みんな、おはよう。{$P$}さんから\n海美ちゃんに伝言を頼まれたんだ。", "zh": "大家早上好。{$P$}先生让我给海美捎个口信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "46c2d6355d7c4acd358d958d8263fc3a5626ff88a182cb24952eb61fc0c0c1ea", "ja": "急ぎの仕事で夕方まで合流できないんだって。\nだから、何か困ったことがあったら、私に言ってね。", "zh": "听说制作人因为有急事，要到傍晚才能和我们会合。\n所以，如果遇到什么困难，就告诉我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "dfc75cc6083b3194f8a08b086c441b2fbfcba730ebf941820e9f35691d78af9e", "ja": "そうなんだ……仕方ないね。ありがとう美咲ちゃん！\n……それじゃ、準備運動から始めよっか！", "zh": "原来如此……没办法呢。谢谢你，美咲！\n……那么，就从热身运动开始吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1011_null", "source_sha256": "d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c", "ja": "数時間後……", "zh": "几小时后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "096225a30ea61f31161927cdf9f333c60b5b92264f2e5d88495b518c0694e78e", "ja": "はーい、ここまでー！　みんないい感じだね♪\nちょっと続けちゃったし、一旦休憩にしようか！", "zh": "好——到这里！大家的状态都很不错呢♪\n不知不觉练了有一会儿，先休息一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "1bf77a647107a2692229e082cd73b54a460825bb7bed384b8dff653ab3e00130", "ja": "お疲れ様ー！　よかったら、みんなでお昼にしない？\nお弁当たくさん作ってきたんだよ♪", "zh": "辛苦啦——！大家要不要一起吃午饭？\n我做了好多便当带过来哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "5f696f48743bdafbd25cf3ca4adaa40623e1e6c3d14474dc889d66f86b23f06e", "ja": "お弁当？　やったー！\nいっぱい動いたから、もうお腹ぺこぺこ～。えへへ♪", "zh": "便当？太好了——！\n动了这么多，肚子已经饿得咕咕叫了～。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "ecf763cd3a6fdcf4a2ace8dece3bccfc224afe0d3e37ff9f6d6227cc505bb55b", "ja": "はう～、ロコもハングリーですぅ。\nランチでいろいろチャージさせてください～。", "zh": "呜～，ROCO也饿肚子了。午饭请让我好好补充营养吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "d8e7546e2379b15feace3eac59d83b9b9c7a52462cf73dcf39ed6e951309adb4", "ja": "うん、そうしよう！\n動いた後は、美味しいごはんで栄養補給！", "zh": "嗯，就这么办！\n运动之后，就要吃顿美味的饭菜补充营养！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "6f41d7d0c6595b9d5b7fb6c23720f1830b660978ec01c0a02223ca05ce589315", "ja": "ターッチ！　くふふ♪\nタッチしたから、次はあみが鬼だぞ！", "zh": "碰到你啦！咕呼呼♪\n因为我碰到了你，接下来就轮到亚美当鬼啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "6cbc2d41ce7f61848ab9e75441b388475221c89d57754ff6f432ccb5999a7a3f", "ja": "ぐぬぬっ。なかなかやりおる……。\nでも次はそうは行かぬぞー……とりゃあーっ！", "zh": "唔唔……还挺厉害的嘛……\n不过下一次可没那么容易了——看招——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "8a45b8d0f4352fad8dd32db9a9f297ddde8ecffb7b2aa9c3b5e328d83b49d121", "ja": "たまきだって負けないぞ－！　にっげろ～！！", "zh": "环环也不会输的——！快逃呀～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1020_102mis", "source_sha256": "e3e750f5750cdd9f21495f7bf187983c34e66341fa5b7f7936ad920e22f7f46a", "ja": "あっ……亜美ちゃん、環ちゃん！\n食べてすぐ動いて、お腹痛くしないでね～！", "zh": "啊……亚美、环！\n吃完东西马上活动，小心别把肚子弄疼了哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1021_025roc", "source_sha256": "3b6c5c0bf7c976571edd7a776b215e613bd73f91a8eb865ee3a113dbbf1df6c7", "ja": "タマキとアミはパワフルですね……。\nロコはレッスンだけで、もうヘトヘトです～。", "zh": "小环和亚美真有活力啊……\nROCO光是上课就已经累得筋疲力尽了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "362352ab1ef92d1bb62cc76eb0be0a0d1999a9593d02cc76c310b4eddee21e87", "ja": "でも、海美ちゃんのダンスレッスン、\nすっごく楽しかったよね！", "zh": "不过，和海美一起上舞蹈课，真的超开心的，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1023_025roc", "source_sha256": "294d9c4e5d14ed8981f15a1dbe482ef90f83c9a24497d8a144a758b6618d4ff7", "ja": "えへへ、そうですね。ウミと一緒にダンスするスポーツ\nなら、ロコもウェルカムです……元気なら、ですけど。", "zh": "嘿嘿，是啊。要是和海美一起跳舞的运动，ROCO也欢迎参加……不过，得有精神才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "97690ce7c45bd550ce97763289ad58da2165e3cf279d4b675106358b2b508b96", "ja": "えへへ、よかった！　ねえねえスポーツって意味では、\n私のレッスンも体育祭も、どっちも同じじゃない？", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了！话说回来，要是从运动的意义上来说，我的训练和体育祭，不都是一样的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1025_025roc", "source_sha256": "95eb4aaf086a54d8ba3ad10dcad3f0e4ed1c77b10e48429a59d803f850f1dde7", "ja": "え、違いますよ？　体育祭は、その……\nクラスの順位とかもありますし。", "zh": "诶，不一样吧？运动会那个……还会有班级排名什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1026_102mis", "source_sha256": "6e7f985cd0f93bd6085ced53c3baa38f616dad18826c15ba6e738a4d48a1c7ec", "ja": "体育祭？　懐かしいなぁ～。クラス一丸になって、\n優勝争いとかになると、すっごく盛り上がるんだよね♪", "zh": "体育祭？真让人怀念啊～。全班齐心协力，争夺冠军什么的，可是会特别热闹呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1027_025roc", "source_sha256": "f1fde245be442e186b922f160d8e84f3852ce87b238402d8b2e8fc07201d534e", "ja": "は、はい。優勝をコンフリクトすれば、\nですけど……。はぁ。", "zh": "是、是的。要是能争夺冠军的话……不过……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "bc9f8661ccd1fdf97b0eb515b563e2de2d6cf19e21453464709ad2e89d1ed00a", "ja": "え、ええっと～、美咲さん！\nお弁当の卵焼き、すっごく美味しかったです！", "zh": "呃、呃那个～美咲小姐！\n便当里的玉子烧，真的特别好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1029_102mis", "source_sha256": "2e77af12a2b075398fa5fcd332f2349e43cd8c28fb8f4201d25c8d03d44ed636", "ja": "わぁ、よかった！　雑魚を1パック全部入れたら\nあふれちゃって、どうしようかと思ったんだ～♪", "zh": "哇，太好了！我把整整1盒小杂鱼都倒进去了，\n结果都溢了出来，当时还在想要怎么办呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1030_025roc", "source_sha256": "71478c688147148a4f58480623cee71b2312f2f57d1c1ee726e2a47e695c0bf8", "ja": "そ、そうそう、唐揚げもマーベラスでした！\nおかげでバッチリチャージできましたよ♪", "zh": "对、对了对了，炸鸡也棒极了！多亏了它，我已经充满电啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1031_029umi", "source_sha256": "d92413b34a8e220ead8f688b306a0d3a6690050868457d41e3fbf31babb55f49", "ja": "そっか……。ダンスは楽しめても、\nやっぱり違うんだ。うーん……。", "zh": "原来如此……虽然能享受跳舞的乐趣，\n但果然还是不一样啊。嗯……】【。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1033_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1034_p", "source_sha256": "8aaa381cee0edf7aafd655b76ffd17629a4223c70f06077b76722d0e63c215db", "ja": "ごめんごめん、すっかり遅くなった。\nみんな、お疲れ様！", "zh": "对不起对不起，完全耽搁晚了。\n大家，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1035_040tam", "source_sha256": "e9b68ea53e4a69ecb30c3e26704da1985495b2b7430ad5838c3e3ab12963c674", "ja": "おやぶん、お帰りなさーい！\nたまきね、みんなといーっぱい踊ったんだぞ！", "zh": "大哥，欢迎回来——！\n环酱呀，和大家一起跳了好多好多舞哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1036_011ami", "source_sha256": "53b9431ae0c5c5c68efb74b457fcb0575b46ddc1c4a3ca57df313b2a02b1687c", "ja": "兄ちゃん、お帰りやすー！\n亜美ね、みんなといーっぱい遊んだんだよ！", "zh": "哥哥，欢迎回来——！\n亚美呀，和大家一起玩了好多好多哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1037_p", "source_sha256": "9e049f44412984d41a28f20a4cd27cb8c5f41dca1d1dbfb1cab5bf89de8c15a7", "ja": "そうか、えらいぞ環！　亜美はあとで話があるからな。\nロコと可奈は順調か？", "zh": "这样啊，真了不起，环！亜美，待会儿我有话要跟你说。\nROCO和可奈进行得还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1038_025roc", "source_sha256": "aff614d992564c98f5579eee647d774048bea14512637beb623bd55c71e80230", "ja": "はい～、もう限界ですけど、ウミのレッスンは\n最後までエンジョイできました♪", "zh": "是～，虽然已经到极限了，但海美的课程我还是享受到最后了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1039_036kan", "source_sha256": "32dfe98b3bd2e74720cb524c94ae80672158ae7dad624481c5a56597bd883229", "ja": "最後は振り付けもバッチリ揃いました！\n息ピッタリ～♪　歌ったり踊ったり～♪", "zh": "最后连舞蹈动作也完全整齐了！\n配合超默契～♪ 又唱又跳～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1040_011ami", "source_sha256": "617fad8a98eccdfbc2b680160f12e59256769652651989f2a81c35e0156a32d8", "ja": "ロコロコもかなりんも、メッチャ頑張ってたもんね。\n亜美のモノマネ特訓にも、よくぞ耐えた！", "zh": "ROCOROCO和可奈也都拼命努力了呢。\n居然能忍受亚美的模仿特训，真是厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1041_p", "source_sha256": "0222df961a23511a69cea31914190dccbc323c44e7dfa93087b8f01b67b70786", "ja": "なぜそんな特訓を……まあいい。\n海美、いろいろ任せっぱなしですまないな。", "zh": "为什么要进行那种特训……不过算了。海美，很多事情都一直交给你，真是不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1042_029umi", "source_sha256": "0c362b0c8b32943e406df24ebdb6ffec8854a60ab5aae6f9384c29740cf91640", "ja": "へっ？　……あ、ううん！\nみんな、すっごく動けてたから平気だったよ！", "zh": "诶？……啊，不是！大家都表现得特别好，所以没关系啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1043_029umi", "source_sha256": "9b3d19314c2ac4f595365f2fe96f356efb062c0f7a0e77d1a4a81ee234c98c2b", "ja": "ロコロコもかなりんも、コツをつかんだら\nぐーんって出来るようになったし！", "zh": "ROCO、ROCO和可奈，掌握诀窍后，也一下子就进步了很多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1044_036kan", "source_sha256": "e5057c137c6be8617893ff028d6e25da7efa99bcc13ee970f5f8e3a7138f4f67", "ja": "そうなんです、{$P$}さん！\n海美ちゃんが丁寧に教えてくれたおかげです♪", "zh": "就是这样，{$P$}先生！多亏了海美耐心地教我♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1045_p", "source_sha256": "79b222f1b38a8eec3ee5df246b15b15b3d4eaa7df476457cae4212134eb2084f", "ja": "へえ、二人ともすごいじゃないか。\nそれじゃ、そのまま続けて……。", "zh": "哦，你们两个都很厉害嘛。那就照这样继续……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1046_029umi", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1047_p", "source_sha256": "bdbe540e6761b03a866b633c554a1b91627cb66aaa24e5253265b5f86875130c", "ja": "（海美？　溜息なんて珍しいな……？）", "zh": "（海美？居然会叹气，真少见啊……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1048_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1049_p", "source_sha256": "efc7689eb46725af04bdaa277b9dcc13b980ea091d2cc44c58d8ea410d665663", "ja": "今日はこれくらいにして……\n戸締まりを確認しておこうかな。", "zh": "今天就先到这里……\n确认一下门窗是否锁好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1050_029umi", "source_sha256": "e59f8eead16eb5b82b0ddbea625f8c295fd2901cc395854565172ef45b6a3dfd", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー……。", "zh": "一、二、三、四……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1051_p", "source_sha256": "3bf835426208f50a0507dd39a36019721bc890497d6fdbeb14d698ce2ddb917b", "ja": "あれ？　この声は……。\nレッスンルームの方からだ。", "zh": "咦？这个声音是……\n是从练习室那边传来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1052_p", "source_sha256": "d04cf87f2efd3b6aec9525fc73ff001780fd9f70057b9e18ecd245b95091950a", "ja": "やっぱり、海美だったか。\nまだ起きてたんだな。", "zh": "果然是海美啊。\n还没睡呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1053_029umi", "source_sha256": "bfa21f75a990066ccf5ac97e51c97033b8e620a054a98676cae91001523a8bbd", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\nみんなと一緒に寝ようと思ったんだけどね……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n本来想和大家一起睡的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1054_029umi", "source_sha256": "f698134cf3a007a2bb1fba5ed7a7d74eaba579a3d03ca5e6dda8e830c02e98ca", "ja": "考え事してたら、眠れなくなっちゃって。\nちょっと抜け出してきちゃった。えへへっ。", "zh": "想事情想得睡不着了。\n所以就偷偷溜出来了。嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1055_p", "source_sha256": "5c2d3512b4eff880dd4f5e51b264fe581bb1e68468d1dad95dc85f46593a61f2", "ja": "海美、何かあったのか？\nレッスンを見てて、少し気になってはいたけど……。", "zh": "海美，发生什么事了吗？\n看你练习的时候，我就有点在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1056_029umi", "source_sha256": "2f0ff316b47cd67ff1a8b7f0bd8853328a1d17e67d49dccc010c0b61e2436cb5", "ja": "あー……うん。あのね……ロコロコも、\nアイドルのレッスンは楽しいんだって！", "zh": "啊……嗯。那个……ROCOROCO也说，\n偶像的训练很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1057_029umi", "source_sha256": "2c1258bac65890e7990790445bfb3601c6d44b4bcb4696e5f1656b4938459aae", "ja": "でも、他のスポーツは違うみたい。\n体育祭とか、やっぱり気が進まないって。", "zh": "不过，其他运动好像不太一样。她说，像体育祭之类的，果然还是提不起劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1058_p", "source_sha256": "7b5c53acca7e7b6e84c737329e2130ee9a5236cd04f3e78f53ce59bcdef698ae", "ja": "そうか。スポーツもいろいろだからな。\n特にダンスは、他とちょっと違うかもしれない。", "zh": "这样啊。运动也有很多种嘛。\n尤其是舞蹈，可能和其他运动有点不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1059_029umi", "source_sha256": "26b4601b9aa977f079aecb6b29a67a11fe856f3e1f2ea3647165988f8ec5f63d", "ja": "そうだね。ダンスは身体が覚えたら、すぐ上手になれる\nけど。走るのとかは、1日で速くならないもんね。", "zh": "是啊。跳舞只要身体记住了动作，很快就能跳得更好\n不过，跑步之类的，可不是1天就能变快的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1060_029umi", "source_sha256": "159be0c3e7a72eb7f297268a1eaae1490c20d340dc2a90409a3256e7d66aa8b1", "ja": "この特訓で楽しく体を動かして、スポーツ好きに\nなってもらえたらな～って思ってたけど、難しそう。", "zh": "我本来想着，要是能通过这次特训愉快地活动身体，让你喜欢上运动就好了，不过好像没那么容易。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1061_029umi", "source_sha256": "3c38d45d1d92c639c96beb23b2fe5d142701f3f178c71e5c3e91ecd8969f9e76", "ja": "私、勘違いしてたんだな～とか考えてたら、\n自分が体を動かしたくなってきたの！", "zh": "我一边想着自己是不是搞错了，结果反而自己想动起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1062_p", "source_sha256": "ac9d10d028b7721cba441829cc8dd7d322416a3b812c2b9bdaa205101814432f", "ja": "なるほど……。\nそれで、踊ってみてスッキリしたか？", "zh": "原来如此……\n所以，跳过之后感觉舒畅些了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1063_029umi", "source_sha256": "becae6fd9d7d07aaac819701e7ab1bafb2cbd4b2c781ba32d16234c6472e391c", "ja": "ううん、あんまり。\nダンスはみんな、楽しそうなんだけどな～。", "zh": "没有，不太灵。\n虽然大家跳舞时好像都挺开心的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1064_029umi", "source_sha256": "26b7007c838da7f18cbe750af4f4e966395292546076dbe6df3740f901222686", "ja": "自信がないから、そう思っちゃうのかな？\nでもでも、自信を持つのってどうするんだろう～？", "zh": "是因为没有自信，所以才会这么想吗？不过不过，要怎么才能拥有自信呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1065_p", "source_sha256": "d81ea5e8f4414796a58fe67a74cc791829c0c8e8d45f39c5893d1ef82a131b2e", "ja": "たとえば、海美はどうしてるんだ？\nステージで失敗が怖い時は、どんなことを考える？", "zh": "比如说，海美是怎么做的？\n害怕在舞台上失败时，你会想些什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1066_029umi", "source_sha256": "8b5b336335c952fcb6ffb4301e6c0cbe6229e3e10a41770436500475d68405cb", "ja": "私？　そうだな……私なら……\n自分を信じるかも！", "zh": "我？嗯……要是我的话……\n我可能会相信自己吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1067_029umi", "source_sha256": "5536752defd08de7a4e6c802c94cded55d112b73e101c493b2cd191bffda5738", "ja": "だってそういう時って、弱気になってると思うから。\n「大丈夫、うまくいく、ちゃんとできる！」って。", "zh": "因为我觉得，这种时候就是变得没自信了嘛。\n“没事的，一定会顺利的，我肯定能做到！”这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1068_p", "source_sha256": "5ba92859b07922d425b6015c659e7886eb191788ec17a5163dade597435114b0", "ja": "うん、そうだよな。でも自信がない人は、文字通り、\nそれができないんだろうな。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。但没有自信的人，就正如字面意思一样，\n根本做不到那一点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1069_029umi", "source_sha256": "e99b52054687ce83ca4718d64cf3860ee3bfaaf429e251aeaeb6146efff2573d", "ja": "あ、うん……そうだよね。\nうまくできないから……。", "zh": "啊，嗯……是啊。\n因为做不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1070_p", "source_sha256": "8c33078101829a15998fb9ceffe6a253ef57da4635f31502fb74d8d42034212e", "ja": "でも今日みたいに、海美が引っぱってあげることは\nできる。……それでいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "不过，像今天这样，由海美拉你一把还是做得到的。……这样不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1071_029umi", "source_sha256": "4d20d11e25f35b889a9626b8257c9e3d505fb24a6a19bacb0596ccd10e177e08", "ja": "引っぱって……。応援するってこと？", "zh": "带动大家……是去为她们加油的意思吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1072_p", "source_sha256": "e948bddcdb5bc4fa3ddd83bb7abdd7364cc82adca6dc693dcd2175044425a792", "ja": "そう。応援して励まして、背中を押してあげて。自信が\nないままでも走りだせば、走った分は前に進めるから。", "zh": "对。为他们加油、鼓励他们，推他们一把。即使还没有自信就迈开脚步，只要跑起来，跑了多远，就能向前走多远。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1073_029umi", "source_sha256": "80f8bc2d579cdbacaf126802c739a6c8b85e1e0e3dbbc218bceb7b9e919f7019", "ja": "私の応援……うん、いい！　いいよそれ！\nいつでも私が応援してるよって♪", "zh": "为我加油……嗯，好！这个好！我会一直为你加油哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1074_029umi", "source_sha256": "6d76c2725284baa55b6fb046543c02d3ef3e961e3b1565a29d63368000c7630e", "ja": "それじゃすぐ、ロコロコにも話してみる！　不安でも、\n私やみんなと頑張ったこと思い出してって！", "zh": "那我马上也去跟ROCOROCO说说！就算感到不安，也要想起和我还有大家一起努力过的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1075_p", "source_sha256": "7bcb7c44f5826abfeb3c0be4ea933799a8dcd68f16dc54b16517abe7e8a5e6bc", "ja": "ああ！　ただ、もうみんな寝てるから、\n話は明日にした方がいいかもな。", "zh": "啊！不过，大家已经都睡了，还是明天再说比较好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1076_029umi", "source_sha256": "7b06332333c497e338c6552ba8316ba49b605e665a5783095141119156c4a1af", "ja": "あっ！　それもそうだね……えへへっ♪\nじゃあ、そうするね！", "zh": "啊！也是呢……嘿嘿♪\n那就这么办吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1077_029umi", "source_sha256": "71474c519b0d24edc23c0f02211748c03dc6202ca5d33a610592a5a7dad4c616", "ja": "それから……。えへへ、{$P$}？\nえへへ、ありがとね！", "zh": "然后……嘿嘿，{$P$}？\n嘿嘿，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1078_029umi", "source_sha256": "898bf8212aa7eda1386d3feb9251c05719708d2a4eeeaccd4178a47b03819881", "ja": "ロコロコだけじゃなくて、今度の公演でも……。\nあの曲で私、たくさんの人を応援したい。", "zh": "不仅是ROCOROCO，在这次公演中我也……。\n我想用那首歌为许许多多的人加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1079_029umi", "source_sha256": "9025003442863317a2af1b769d49a9b0791a08c5e063cfe5ede97cd532bdee0f", "ja": "一緒に踊ってくれた人、曲を聴いた人全員が、\n元気になっちゃうようなステージにしたい！", "zh": "我想打造这样一场舞台：让和我一起跳舞的人，以及听到这首歌的所有人，都能打起精神来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1080_p", "source_sha256": "8adbf5f8a2c8eaa393a408cf78c0d2ee88d02047e5f1c7cc39590d319b35e13d", "ja": "うん。海美らしくて、すごくいい目標だ。\n俺も協力するよ。", "zh": "嗯。很有海美的风格，是非常棒的目标。\n我也会全力协助你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1081_p", "source_sha256": "3f5c68bbbfde0d2356d6abc67d6851709c990327ff0588513a1c802a716b7948", "ja": "だけど、もう時間も遅いし、\nそろそろ寝た方がいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "不过时间也不早了，是不是该差不多去睡了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1082_029umi", "source_sha256": "fde78964e65d5adf55fbca0936e1d7c6afdcc28e9d753a10660ead54224f6605", "ja": "えーっ！　目標が決まったから、\n今すぐレッスンしたい気分なんだけど……。", "zh": "诶——！既然目标已经定下来了，现在就想马上去训练……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1083_029umi", "source_sha256": "14b6d183a604443d65e766460f696e39677f694b1998da8e40650f849b1ee544", "ja": "{$P$}、お願いっ！\n明日はちゃんと起きるから……あとちょっとだけ！", "zh": "{$P$}，拜托了！\n我明天一定会好好起床的……再多一会儿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1084_p", "source_sha256": "676ea8cfdb6b21ad699d501d16971784b1a7463cd045a39d6cc258a648f496ab", "ja": "……はあ、仕方ないな。\n無理するんじゃないぞ？", "zh": "……唉，真拿你没办法。\n可别太勉强了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1085_029umi", "source_sha256": "11a712c97f64dda9f40b966773298f508761675a5c6654e5aa7ff9ac15164c57", "ja": "はーい！　ちょっと見直すだけだから……そうだ！\n{$P$}も一緒に踊ろうよ！", "zh": "好——！只是稍微重新确认一下而已……对了！\n{$P$}先生也一起来跳舞吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1086_029umi", "source_sha256": "b65372f330bd1dd100934b3c755d913b7d2ffdb901a6c3be1648ca6a92f46a8e", "ja": "体を動かしたら、きっとよく眠れるよー！\nそれに誰かと一緒の方が楽しいでしょ？", "zh": "活动一下身体，一定能睡个好觉哦——！\n而且和别人一起不是更开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_1087", "source_sha256": "cad1f98ef24dcc36282c8acbb20f6736cc2786b9df5b0c3d75b118375315ab73", "ja": "よしきた！", "zh": "好嘞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_2000_p", "source_sha256": "c724e4b3fabfb524ca9477ae60814d76c666fd5e6973e59d4509588e7cce168f", "ja": "わかった。1回だけ付き合うよ。\n最近運動できてないから、お手柔らかにな！", "zh": "知道了。就陪你跳1次吧。\n最近都没怎么运动，手下留情啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_089_2001_029umi", "source_sha256": "862301e52828ae15cc51d343a44499e65d64ed2ececbaabd395c3313db33f47f", "ja": "あはっ☆　そうこなくちゃ！\nそれじゃ行くよー。ミュージック……スタート♪", "zh": "啊哈☆　这才对嘛！\n那么要开始啰——音乐……启动♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
